    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        MoS-VLA: A <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Action</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> with One-Shot Skill Adaptation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhao%2C+R">Ruihan Zhao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ingebrand%2C+T">Tyler Ingebrand</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chinchali%2C+S">Sandeep Chinchali</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Topcu%2C+U">Ufuk Topcu</a>
      
