        Zero-shot <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> via Search in Memory
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Malato%2C+F">Federico Malato</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hautam%C3%A4ki%2C+V">Ville Hautamäki</a>
      
